Age: In order to apply for ADCB’s credit card, the applicant should fall in the age group of 21 years to 65 years.
Income: Each of the ADCB Credit Card comes with a minimum monthly income requirement. It means that the applicant should have a steady source of income. They must have proof of permanent monthly income to be eligible for ADCB credit cards.
