bodies from the river

uttering joyous cries we practiced thinning, wind resistance,

disrupted insect mating habits

& in those early days our manly love it never failed
in June the water's always high and deep

(we knew that sometime this might prove quite detrimental)

forces of expertise and resources lay shimmering at our doorstep

and well you know quite frankly

we could figure nothing finer for the democratic tourist

