as a leading statesman has said:

civilization is benevolence

in the province of Ontario!

well heck my gentlemen.

how unfaltering, how faithful can you get.

an obscure decider (and this was my only grievance against him)

the judge was

just terrific otherwise

you know that otherwise _our_ crowds of boys

