Earlier versions of some of the poems in this book appeared in _from Waltzing_ (BookThug, 2014), _Vegetable Inventory_ (Ferno House, 2013), the _Dusie_ Tuesday Poem series (curated by rob mclennan, 2014), and _eleveneleven_ (2017).

