# major debts / reading list

My thinking about colonialism and decolonization in Canada (including the significance of particular ideas about nature and wilderness) has been strongly shaped by reading and listening to the work of the Indigenous writers, theorists, and leaders listed here. None of their words have been mixed into the poems. I am not suggesting that any of these thinkers endorse this text, nor that the ideas explored in _Better Nature_ are accurate reflections of their work. Any and all failures of understanding and expression are my own.

